// endpoint_report_desktop_banner_posted.proto — ReportDesktopBannerPosted:
// the notifier app answers whether the platform took one banner it was
// handed. DESKTOP NOTIFIER section.
//
// The app calls it exactly once per banner WatchDesktopBanners hands it, as
// soon as macOS's notification center accepts or refuses the banner. The
// daemon rings the banner's chime and holds it for a focus gain's claim only
// once it is POSTED, so a banner the platform refused never makes a sound or
// steers the user anywhere. A post that no answer reaches in time is recorded
